title: "Zero-cost retrieval-augmented rare disease diagnosis: code and artefacts"
abstract: >-
  Code, prompts, archived model responses and result tables for a study showing that a
  benchmark built by sampling a disease's own annotations reverses the measured value of
  large language model re-ranking, of the retriever, and of fusion tuning.
